' 4+1 process view - Process view · processes and threads of execution (development and compose)
' Version 1.1 - 2026-11-10
' For: whoever writes code and whoever debugs.
' Documented decision: The API and the email worker run in the same process; SKIP LOCKED allows several instances (ADR 0004).
' Not drawn: internal detail of the classes.
@startuml process-runtime
!include ../style.puml

title Process view - processes and threads of execution (development and compose)

left to right direction

actor "Operator" as P_OPS
component "Browser\n[One JavaScript thread per tab]" as C_BROWSER
component "Next.js\n[Node.js process (event loop)]" as C_WEB
component "ASP.NET Core API\n[.NET 10 process, Kestrel, thread pool]" as C_API
component "Outbox worker\n[BackgroundService in the API process]" as C_WORKER
component "seed-demo, set-admin-password\n[The same executable, another process]" as C_CLI
database "PostgreSQL\n[PostgreSQL 18.6, one process per connection]" as C_DB
component "SMTP server" as X_SMTP <<external>>

C_BROWSER --> C_WEB : Requests pages and calls /api/* (same origin)\n[HTTP, cookies]
C_WEB --> C_API : Forwards /api/* (Next.js rewrites);\nServer Components call /api/auth/me and the\nclub page\n[HTTP, API_INTERNAL_URL]
C_API --> C_WORKER : Hosts it in the same process; starts and stops with\nthe host\n[AddHostedService]
C_API --> C_DB : Reads and writes in short transactions\n[SQL (Npgsql)]
C_WORKER --> C_DB : Claims a batch and saves the result\n[FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED]
C_WORKER --> X_SMTP : Sends, one connection per message (asynchronous)\n[SMTP (MailKit)]
P_OPS --> C_CLI : Runs\n[docker compose run --rm api …]
C_CLI --> C_DB : Migrations, admin seed and the command\n[SQL]
@enduml
